  {
    "id": 1307254259,
    "oid": "T2gJWVm3LHMz7pdmtQSVlA",
    "fullBleed": 0,
    "text": "<div><span style=\"color:#f9f9ea;\" class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;\" class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\" class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\">[PT]</span> </span><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"bold\">A cor do pecado</span></span> é uma reportagem visual que investiga a interferência da ancestralidade no processo de identificação racial no Brasil, analisando<span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\"> como </span>dados genéticos, os fatores socioeconômicos e as narrativas particulares se entrelaçam na construção da identidade de brasileiros autodeclarados pardos.</span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\" style=\"color:#f9f9ea;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\" class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\">[EN] </span></span><span class=\"texteditor-inline-fontsize\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-style:oblique 9deg;\"><span class=\"bold\"><span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\" style=\"color:#f9f9ea;\">The color of sin</span></span> </span><span style=\"color:#f9f9ea;\" class=\"texteditor-inline-color\">is a popular –yet problematic– Brazilian expression used to refer to mixed race people. This proj<span class=\"texteditor-inline-color\">ect</span> investigates how genetic data, socioeconomic factors, and personal narratives intertwine in the construction the \"pardo\" (mixed-race) identity and the growing influence of genetic ancestry in this self-identification process. </span></span></div>",
    "alignment": "center",
    "__typename": "TextModule"
  },
